    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/8057fdbba2ad081f80830cd59115c4db.poster.avif?t=1755536109\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/8057fdbba2ad081f80830cd59115c4db.webm?t=1755536109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/8057fdbba2ad081f80830cd59115c4db.mp4?t=1755536109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mysterious and relaxing adventure alongside the brave Indica Macjones as you search for the fabled <strong>Holy Grail</strong>. Along your journey, you\u2019ll meet charming furry companions, solve ancient puzzles, and explore hidden, magical locations where secrets are waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/87a07bcea14f31373f7533f524d694c3.avif?t=1755536109\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of this expedition, you\u2019ll need to study ancient maps, manage your resources, and send out teams to explore uncharted lands. Every decision could bring you closer to discovering the Grail \u2013 but be prepared for unexpected challenges and surprises along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the best traditions of classic adventure films, <strong>Furry Adventure Club and the Holy Grail\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udd81 is all about fun exploration and puzzle-solving as you chase down one of the greatest legends ever. Ready to join the adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Discover a world filled with vibrant furry characters, each with their own unique stories and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Explore diverse locations, from ancient forests to magical castles, in your quest for the Golden Grail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Solve a variety of puzzles and challenges, including exciting match-3 gameplay, to progress through the story and uncover hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Enjoy beautiful landscapes and detailed characters, all presented in a charming cartoon style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Calm and chill environment with Lofi Soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Join the Furry Adventure Club and embark on your magical quest today!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/ea63b9066e7df5f8186d5e82e0bca584.webp?t=1755536109\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/8057fdbba2ad081f80830cd59115c4db.poster.avif?t=1755536109\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/8057fdbba2ad081f80830cd59115c4db.webm?t=1755536109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/8057fdbba2ad081f80830cd59115c4db.mp4?t=1755536109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mysterious and relaxing adventure alongside the brave Indica Macjones as you search for the fabled <strong>Holy Grail</strong>. Along your journey, you\u2019ll meet charming furry companions, solve ancient puzzles, and explore hidden, magical locations where secrets are waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/87a07bcea14f31373f7533f524d694c3.avif?t=1755536109\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of this expedition, you\u2019ll need to study ancient maps, manage your resources, and send out teams to explore uncharted lands. Every decision could bring you closer to discovering the Grail \u2013 but be prepared for unexpected challenges and surprises along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the best traditions of classic adventure films, <strong>Furry Adventure Club and the Holy Grail\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udd81 is all about fun exploration and puzzle-solving as you chase down one of the greatest legends ever. Ready to join the adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Discover a world filled with vibrant furry characters, each with their own unique stories and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Explore diverse locations, from ancient forests to magical castles, in your quest for the Golden Grail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Solve a variety of puzzles and challenges, including exciting match-3 gameplay, to progress through the story and uncover hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Enjoy beautiful landscapes and detailed characters, all presented in a charming cartoon style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Calm and chill environment with Lofi Soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81Join the Furry Adventure Club and embark on your magical quest today!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057290/extras/ea63b9066e7df5f8186d5e82e0bca584.webp?t=1755536109\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p>",
